                    {
                        "form_id": "08763293-9017-405a-85a0-850a92a05138",
                        "entry_id": "11393f9d-94cf-3e19-8544-78cb5be0289e",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "эро́тиках"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a57c4292-303b-3e9a-be64-4688d7c207f9",
                        "entry_id": "11393f9d-94cf-3e19-8544-78cb5be0289e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "чувственность, половое влечение, сексуальность"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0afba181-48ff-4da1-9654-e7976c40fedc",
                                "sense_id": "a57c4292-303b-3e9a-be64-4688d7c207f9",
                                "text": "Книжность, романтизм, изысканность, эротика — вот характерные признаки «александрийской» поэзии."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "03b10730-3e83-312a-a390-fdc04919b4c3",
                        "entry_id": "11393f9d-94cf-3e19-8544-78cb5be0289e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "собир. совокупность всего, что связано с проявлением чувственности, сексуальной привлекательности (во внешности, в манере поведения, в интимных отношениях и т. п.)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f624deca-1a85-4c2a-8cec-94e4c7cbab72",
                                "sense_id": "03b10730-3e83-312a-a390-fdc04919b4c3",
                                "text": "Не девушка, а сплошная эротика — даже этот невинный жест в её исполнении имеет глубокий сексуальный смысл."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "69d07584-667a-345c-8e34-941ca35d412d",
                        "entry_id": "11393f9d-94cf-3e19-8544-78cb5be0289e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "особое внимание к описанию, изображению обнажённого тела, половых отношений; сексуальная направленность произведений массовой культуры"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "027bd384-76c2-4b8c-ae5e-5c654946e245",
                                "sense_id": "69d07584-667a-345c-8e34-941ca35d412d",
                                "text": "Открылись эротические театры, порнопродукция стала вытеснять искусство, телевидение слишком увлеклось дозволенностью темы и в погоне за зрителем достигло обратного эффекта — эротика на экране стала раздражать."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1ad02910-bdc1-3f33-9c84-a92ce16d1f96",
                        "entry_id": "11393f9d-94cf-3e19-8544-78cb5be0289e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг., собир. произведения литературы и искусства, насыщенные чувственностью, посвящённые описанию, изображению проявления полового влечения, сексуальности"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "133d8e94-e09d-466b-a954-4b07c03afdad",
                                "sense_id": "1ad02910-bdc1-3f33-9c84-a92ce16d1f96",
                                "text": "Эротика Брюсова — подражание древним поэтам."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "00659b7f-73d7-409b-8283-dda77d399ce5",
                        "source_entry_id": "11393f9d-94cf-3e19-8544-78cb5be0289e",
                        "source_sense_description": "чувственность, половое влечение, сексуальность",
                        "target_lang_word": "eroticism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "eroticism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fb69232e-2ea5-38a8-b82c-9892ff2f345b",
                                        "entry_id": "e8108111-1a14-35bc-b74b-65b264d3d6cf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "the state of being erotic, or of being sexually aroused"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2bcfd579-072c-3e2a-8a14-4f08a0a577bf",
                                        "entry_id": "e8108111-1a14-35bc-b74b-65b264d3d6cf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "sexual excitement, especially if abnormally persistent"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "62a34f02-67ee-3177-a6e4-c3dc5336be46",
                                        "entry_id": "e8108111-1a14-35bc-b74b-65b264d3d6cf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "a sexual interest in something; an attraction, fetish, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65d672c4-e63c-4cfc-9cad-155ae0fa9723",
                                                "sense_id": "62a34f02-67ee-3177-a6e4-c3dc5336be46",
                                                "text": "There is a range of fantasies available to all of us in this culture. I think that everyone has a range of possibilities. Nevertheless, we all specialize; we all have preferences. A lot of people have those [sadomasochistic] fantasies cut ^([sic]) it isn't their primary eroticism, or even something they want to try."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "44932b51-ef57-41ca-8b77-b1423536e87d",
                        "source_entry_id": "11393f9d-94cf-3e19-8544-78cb5be0289e",
                        "source_sense_description": "чувственность, половое влечение, сексуальность",
                        "target_lang_word": "erotyka",
                        "target_lang_code": "pl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "erotyka",
                                "target_lang_code": "pl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9533de9b-b702-3bdb-842e-af2f3cdc98a0",
                                        "entry_id": "119fdd96-9e8d-3a52-8760-a16fdaa22176",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ogół tego, co erotyczne, związane z erotyzmem, tematyką miłosną"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8ad4824b-4ea3-468a-ae19-5de7af229c0b",
                        "source_entry_id": "11393f9d-94cf-3e19-8544-78cb5be0289e",
                        "source_sense_description": "произведения литературы и искусства, насыщенные чувственностью, посвящённые описанию, изображению проявления полового влечения, сексуальности",
                        "target_lang_word": "erotica",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "erotica",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "075b1240-92c2-35c4-995e-e6567b2d36e0",
                                        "entry_id": "bf42a74a-8425-3233-bbe4-87efff1b4879",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Erotic literature, art, decoration, or other such work."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3b6d106-7771-4803-9100-a775b5d1c310",
                                                "sense_id": "075b1240-92c2-35c4-995e-e6567b2d36e0",
                                                "text": "There's a fine line between erotica and pornography."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3636dd0-935b-46a8-9302-8c5bd179a246",
                                                "sense_id": "075b1240-92c2-35c4-995e-e6567b2d36e0",
                                                "text": "In fact, eighteenth-century British erotica has been the subject of unremitting attention for the last two decades."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf2188a8-33a6-33e0-aa19-6ca8f4e65a46",
                                        "entry_id": "bf42a74a-8425-3233-bbe4-87efff1b4879",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A work of erotica."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd10185b-ab81-491d-98c6-002ab21592ee",
                                                "sense_id": "cf2188a8-33a6-33e0-aa19-6ca8f4e65a46",
                                                "text": "Rather a principal avenue of traffic and distribution of eroticas is the social network of age-peers ([…])."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3fc87a7b-6d28-4091-a7e8-32c9427fd02b",
                                                "sense_id": "cf2188a8-33a6-33e0-aa19-6ca8f4e65a46",
                                                "text": "Some films advertised as minor eroticas are so much in demand by the paying public and these have overshadowed the value of a few seminars which seem to draw only the scholars and the film theorists."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b82427db-822d-4793-a5bf-552baed0f0a5",
                                                "sense_id": "cf2188a8-33a6-33e0-aa19-6ca8f4e65a46",
                                                "text": "Tilson carries work by the late John Lennon, including lithographs, a few signed eroticas and republished drawings."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1fa3f19-2c45-4a75-b6ff-e39c4c39d42b",
                                                "sense_id": "cf2188a8-33a6-33e0-aa19-6ca8f4e65a46",
                                                "text": "Though the poetic work of Bhikṣu Padmaśrī, Nāgarasarvasva is an erotica, the writer has not followed Vätsyāyana in his work, rather, he has followed Bharata Muni."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a75ad805-49d1-454d-add5-bc151d2efe28",
                                                "sense_id": "cf2188a8-33a6-33e0-aa19-6ca8f4e65a46",
                                                "text": "His costume dramas (including eroticas) are all imprinted with the hallmark of this spectacular and lyrical “dream factory” of classical China."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
